  "_doc_v2": "Tuning pass 2: finisher needs momentum>=finisher.momentum and boss HP <= bosses.<id>.finisher_hp (default finisher.boss_hp_frac); bows also need focus>=finisher.bow_focus (hold still). momentum.hit scales with blow size (dmg/hit_ref_dmg, 0.8-2.5x). bosses.<id>.shot_taken = arrow damage at any range, far_shot_taken = extra at >= far_gap, momentum_mult = crowd gain vs this boss, second_wind_momentum = momentum kept when the boss rises (finisher locked until then).",
  "_doc_v3": "Tuning pass 3 (deterministic sim seeds): casual melee vs Brutus/Unbroken eased, Varro tougher for bows, finisher rates pulled toward 50-75% (axe momentum_mult 1.25, lower finisher_hp for Brutus/Crixus/Ignatius). Per-boss overrides: bow_focus, momentum_mult_<style>.",
  "_doc_v4": "v4 (arena duel v2): armour_tiers = damage cut / stamina / poise for a full set (else the arena set, the weakest); weapon_tiers = crit bonus (damage via gear_mult); styles.*.crit per TIERS_SPEC (sword 8%, axe 5%); bosses.*.tier/armour_cut scale the champions up the ranks.",
